{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Derby At Stillwater Creek throws you in at the deep-end at the launch of the annual Stillwater Cup, where local anglers prepare to duke it out across 10+ lakes in the most prestigious event of the season. The competition takes place over 10 rounds, through t0+ locations with a hundred grand\u2019s worth of prize money up for grabs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/13ded89c155dc245bef0dc96dca050d1.poster.avif?t=1759912164\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/13ded89c155dc245bef0dc96dca050d1.webm?t=1759912164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/13ded89c155dc245bef0dc96dca050d1.mp4?t=1759912164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment cards can be purchased from the shop or earned through catching fish and there is a huge variety of equipment to add to your fishing toolbox. From hooks, lines, bait and reels, to instant-effect special cards and rare item cards, each equipped card boosts or de-buffs your fishing ability - whether is speed, chance-to-catch or pure luck, you\u2019ll need to choose your equipment wisely before setting off onto the lakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/0b961e5a871f5fc6ea71b0ccb8d15057.poster.avif?t=1759912164\" width=610 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/0b961e5a871f5fc6ea71b0ccb8d15057.webm?t=1759912164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUNT YOUR CATCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once out on the water you\u2019ll need to read the area to discover where your likely catch will be hiding. Will the trout be hanging out in reeds or fallen timber? Will the catfish prefer the shallows or the deeps? Will the sturgeon make a rare appearance near the lily pads? Each fish has favourite swarming areas, favoured hooks and baits and you\u2019ll need to think on your feet, equip the correct inventory at the right times and (if you\u2019re in a tournament session) play to the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/36a23795c42ea8608997ac38ae83414f.poster.avif?t=1759912164\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/36a23795c42ea8608997ac38ae83414f.webm?t=1759912164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/36a23795c42ea8608997ac38ae83414f.mp4?t=1759912164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GET HOOKED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although tournament fishing is not fr the faint-hearted, you also have the option to fish for fun. Head out onto one of your favourite lakes, take in the atmosphere, get yourself a net full of common and rare fish to sell at the dock, and take the day at a pace that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/6e5db416296f3f0733b6a05b7e89bb58.poster.avif?t=1759912164\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/6e5db416296f3f0733b6a05b7e89bb58.webm?t=1759912164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/6e5db416296f3f0733b6a05b7e89bb58.mp4?t=1759912164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1514400?t=1759912164","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/5c1044a2c0d1f3963f057de5e31eef4ccb09bd9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759912164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/d86b65940a15ad50a0c230efb845addc520fffea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759912164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/d86b65940a15ad50a0c230efb845addc520fffea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759912164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Derby At Stillwater Creek throws you in at the deep-end at the launch of the annual Stillwater Cup, where local anglers prepare to duke it out across 10+ lakes in the most prestigious event of the season. The competition takes place over 10 rounds, through t0+ locations with a hundred grand\u2019s worth of prize money up for grabs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514400/extras/13ded89c155dc245bef0dc96dca050d1.poster.avif?t=1759912164\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass